Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:09.82,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.40,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.43,0:01:13.59,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep your head held high!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:15.03,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:16.89,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fly over the waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:20.48,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Our dreams have been carefully joined together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:24.72,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's head for the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:31.10,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,We drift forward, riding the waves,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:35.35,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,meeting people and saying goodbye, then doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:39.59,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,all under this flag...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:44.71,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Pain I don't want to forget is kept in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.78,0:01:48.24,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,There was a day when I softly carved it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:51.91,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone take my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:54.79,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,I grasp it tightly in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:59.74,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now raise your hands up! Sing your dreams out loud.
